content:
Borɔdɔma agu nhyerɛnne;
    na bobe hwa agye baabiara.
  Sɔre bra, me dɔfoɔ;
    mʼahoɔfɛ bra me nkyɛn.”

Mʼaborɔnoma a wohyɛ abotan ntokuro mu
    ahinta wɔ mmepɔ so,
  ma me nhunu wʼanim;
    ma mente wo nne;
  wo nne yɛ dɛ,
    na wʼanim yɛ fɛ.

Anadwo mu nyinaa, wɔ me mpa so
    mehwehwɛɛ deɛ mʼakoma da no so;
    mehwehwɛɛ no, nanso manhunu no.

Monhwɛ, ɛyɛ Salomo teaseɛnam a
    akofoɔ aduosia bɔ no kyidɔm;
    adeɛ a ɛwɔ animuonyam pa ara wɔ Israel,

Adɔdɔdeɛ firi wʼano sɛ ɛwokyɛm, mʼayeforɔ;
    nufosuo ne ɛwoɔ wɔ wo tɛkrɛma ase.
    Wo ntadeɛ mu hwa te sɛ Lebanon deɛ.

Maba me turo mu, me nuabaa, mʼayeforɔ;
    maboaboa me kurobo ne me nnuhwam ano.
  Madi me woɔkyɛm ne ɛwoɔ;
    manom me bobesa ne me nufosuo.
  Ao, nnamfonom, monnidi na monnom;
    Ao, adɔfonom, monnom deɛ ɛbɛmee mo.

Ne ti yɛ sikakɔkɔɔ amapa;
    ne tiri so nwi yɛ kuhaa,
    na ɛyɛ tuntum sɛ kwaakwaadabi.

Ebia na ɔyerenom yɛ aduosia,
    mpenafoɔ bɛyɛ aduɔwɔtwe,
    ne mmabaawa dodoɔ a wɔntumi nkan wɔn;

nanso mʼaborɔnoma a ne ho nni asɛm da mu fua;
    ɔno nko ara ne ne maame babaa,
    ɔno na deɛ ɔwoo no no pɛ nʼasɛm.
  Mmabaawa hunu no no, wɔfrɛɛ no nhyira;
    ahemaa ne mpenafoɔ kamfoo no.

Wo tiri si so sɛ Karmel Bepɔ.
    Wo tirinwi te sɛ adehyetoma a wɔadi mu adwinneɛ;
    wo tirinwi tentene no dwomfa ɔhene.
